      "summary": "Public-apis是一个开源的免费API集合项目，收录了涵盖新闻、金融、娱乐等领域的公共接口。该项目采用结构化分类与标签体系，支持开发者快速检索所需接口资源。所有API均经过可用性验证并附带详细文档说明，有效降低了开发过程中的集成门槛。适用于原型开发、学习测试及需要快速接入第三方服务的应用场景。",
      "updated_at": "2025-09-29T16:05:55Z",
      "summary_en": "A comprehensive, community-driven collection of free APIs for developers. It serves as a central directory for discovering and integrating diverse web services, from weather data to finance and entertainment. Ideal for prototyping, learning, and building applications without API costs. The project is open-source, well-maintained, and widely used for its extensive, categorized listings.",
      "summary_zh": "Public-apis是一个开源的免费API集合项目，收录了涵盖新闻、金融、娱乐等领域的公共接口。该项目采用结构化分类与标签体系，支持开发者快速检索所需接口资源。所有API均经过可用性验证并附带详细文档说明，有效降低了开发过程中的集成门槛。适用于原型开发、学习测试及需要快速接入第三方服务的应用场景。",
      "summary_es": "Lista colaborativa de APIs públicas gratuitas organizadas por categorías. Incluye servicios de datos, herramientas de desarrollo y recursos para aplicaciones. Útil para prototipado rápido, proyectos educativos y desarrollo de MVP. Facilita el acceso a funcionalidades sin necesidad de implementación compleja.",
      "reason_label": "notable",
      "reason_text": "值得关注的项目：public-apis"
